        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"25c063d1-92c9-41b0-9eb0-635acc06e18c\",\"review_text\":\"İts the best app i downloaded in my entire life even if you dont have premium it still works ofc yhe adds are annoying sometimes but still it is an awsomw app\"},{\"review_id\":\"128de432-da9b-4c3a-ad5a-37e49fe55274\",\"review_text\":\"👌🏻⚡️\"},{\"review_id\":\"b3307f20-a589-4554-94b7-dbd4f9c37017\",\"review_text\":\"If you want to restart an app 3 times before you can listen to what you selected or want to wait 2 minutes for a 2 minute song to load then you picked the right app! It's not like that on every boot up, but it happens enough to where you can say it's definitely an issue. Also shout out to the probably 3 people Spotify hire to make the app, no fault on you all just the company.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b504313d-02e3-4498-8d84-7865b4e8eeff\",\"review_text\":\"This app heals..\"},{\"review_id\":\"d54583d1-4467-45ef-a687-2ae45945ae1f\",\"review_text\":\"Take to much longer time to download This not good App. download this app is mistake. YouTube is a good option for listening music 🎵\"},{\"review_id\":\"ea2905d6-6841-4319-b71f-80128b125759\",\"review_text\":\"Now it's not free Every service is paid now Even you cannot decide to listen your fav song\"},{\"review_id\":\"2c566b2f-684b-4cda-940f-23ec9385f61a\",\"review_text\":\"Good app to use. Hopefully more music can be added and customize the app a bit.\"},{\"review_id\":\"62573e56-8185-48e9-9e02-7c57fc87baf9\",\"review_text\":\"After the update i don't really like the app , can't even play the songs i want to hear.\"},{\"review_id\":\"fbb8cab0-eb66-49de-9624-a06015514118\",\"review_text\":\"lol need prem to play music\"},{\"review_id\":\"a0dc5e88-ed17-415e-8b97-8a7992af9963\",\"review_text\":\"I've used Spotify for a few years now, and I've never had a problem. I recommend it to anyone who listens to music or podcasts on a daily basis.\"}]}"
